  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting (Bleeding Hand)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Each card in your deck gains a category from among Physical, Mental, or Spiritual, chosen when you create the card. Whenever you discard a card as part of performing an action, you gain a benefit based on the category of the card discarded.</p>\n<p><em>Physical:</em> You gain a +2 luck bonus a single die roll as part of the action that adds your Strength or Constitution modifier<br>\n<em>Mental:</em> You gain a +2 luck bonus a single die roll as part of the action that adds your Dexterity or Intelligence modifier<br>\n<em>Spiritual:</em> You gain a +2 luck bonus a single die roll as part of the action that adds your Wisdom or Charisma modifier</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
